# `gen build` writes two artifacts. `Cargo.gen.lock` is the committed one —
# the slim delta substrate reconstructs the build graph from, in pure Nix.
# `Cargo.build-spec.json` is the full intermediate it is derived from: same
# information, 2.1× the bytes (417 KB vs 197 KB here), and a second copy to
# keep in sync. Committing both means two artifacts that can disagree.
Cargo.build-spec.json
